        <!-- Previous release -->
        <item>
            <title>Version 1.6.0</title>
            <link>https://github.com/pingfan-hu/MiniCalendar/releases/tag/v1.6.0</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.6.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>新功能 / New Features</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>自动更新</strong>：添加了内置的更新检查功能（基于 Sparkle 框架）</li>
                    <li><strong>Automatic Updates</strong>: Added built-in update checker powered by Sparkle</li>
                    <li>可通过右键菜单检查更新（检查更新 / Check for Updates）</li>
                    <li>每日自动检查更新，支持自动下载安装</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>改进 / Improvements</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>优化提醒列表顺序："单次"提醒现在显示在"逾期"提醒之前</li>
                    <li>Reordered reminder sections: "One-time" now appears before "Overdue"</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sun, 24 Nov 2025 18:30:00 +0800</pubDate>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/pingfan-hu/MiniCalendar/releases/download/v1.6.0/MiniCalendar-v1.6.0.zip"
                       sparkle:version="1.6.0"
                       sparkle:shortVersionString="1.6.0"
                       length="15560145"
                       type="application/octet-stream" />
        </item>

